# Q&A eval set (draft v1)

Purpose: a labeled set of queries used to test how the App classifies and handles questions. Every row has the label the App should produce. Rows marked "Settle" are ones where reasonable people could disagree, so the label must be decided by the product owner before the set is used.

Labels:
- **Factual**: a direct answer about events, people, places.
- **Philosophical**: an answer about meaning, duty, consequence, as the epic treats it.
- **Ambiguous**: both, so the App shows two cited opening sentences plus Tell Me More.
- **Follow-up**: depends on the previous answer. Answered when there is Session Context, declined when there is none.
- **Decline**: out of scope. One polite line (Source and Guardrails, Req 5 to 7).

